    "desc_en": "I can't code. I can't draw. So nine AI (Claude) sessions are making my Roblox game, Halo & Horns: a boss who checks everything, three who write the code, two who draw the art (Adobe Firefly), one who puts it in the game, one who makes the sound effects, and one who made this video. I'm the director. In the game, every choice makes you an angel or a devil. Which one are you? Halloween beta: October 31! Not sponsored. AI voice narration. Sound effects: our own, Adobe Firefly and Kenney (kenney.nl, CC0).",
    "desc_ko": "코딩도 그림도 못 하지만, AI 세션 9개와 로블록스 게임 'Halo & Horns'를 만들어요. 모든 선택이 천사 아니면 악마! 당신은 어느 쪽? 베타 10월 31일.",
